<!-- 설정 창 '레이아웃' 페이지(요건 7) — 현재 화면 저장·백업/복원 관리 진입. 명령은 LayoutPageViewModel, 이 파일에 로직 없음 -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:vms="using:Pd.Poc.Shell.ViewModels.Settings"
             xmlns:loc="using:Pd.Poc.Shell.Localization"
             xmlns:ui="using:Pd.Ui.Controls"
             x:Class="Pd.Ui.Views.Settings.LayoutPage"
             x:DataType="vms:LayoutPageViewModel">
  <StackPanel>
    <ui:SettingsRow SettingId="layoutSave" Label="{loc:Tr menu.ws.layoutSave}">
      <Button Content="{loc:Tr settings.layout.open}" Command="{Binding SaveCurrentCommand}" AutomationProperties.AutomationId="settings.btnLayoutSave" />
    </ui:SettingsRow>
    <ui:SettingsRow SettingId="layoutManage" Label="{loc:Tr menu.ws.layoutManage}">
      <Button Content="{loc:Tr settings.layout.open}" Command="{Binding ManageCommand}" AutomationProperties.AutomationId="settings.btnLayoutManage" />
    </ui:SettingsRow>
  </StackPanel>
</UserControl>
